@startuml Sequence Diagram - Gestionare Caz Urgență

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam maxMessageSize 45
skinparam ParticipantPadding 8
skinparam BoxPadding 4

title Diagramă Secvență - Gestionare Caz Urgență + ATI

actor "Medic" as Doctor
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "API" as API
participant "Emergency\nHelpers" as EHelpers
participant "ICU\nHelpers" as ICUHelpers
database "Database" as DB

== Creare Caz ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Formular\n(patientId/date, triageLevel)
Frontend -> API: POST /api/emergency
API -> EHelpers: createEmergencyCase()
EHelpers -> DB: INSERT emergency_cases\n(state: 'arrival')
DB --> EHelpers: caseId
EHelpers --> API: EmergencyCase
API --> Frontend: 200 OK

== Workflow Tranziții ==
loop Pentru fiecare etapă
    Doctor -> Frontend: Completează formular
    Frontend -> API: POST /api/emergency/[id]/[etapă]
    API -> EHelpers: updateState(caseId, newState)
    EHelpers -> DB: UPDATE currentState\n+ INSERT transition
    DB --> EHelpers: Success
    EHelpers --> API: Updated case
    API --> Frontend: 200 OK
    Frontend -> Frontend: Actualizează Kanban
end

== Transfer în ATI ==
alt Transfer din admission/treatment
    Doctor -> Frontend: Click "Transfer în ATI"
    Frontend -> API: POST /api/emergency/[id]/icu
    API -> ICUHelpers: admitPatient()\n+ findAvailableRoom()
    ICUHelpers -> DB: SELECT icu_rooms\nWHERE available
    DB --> ICUHelpers: Available room
    ICUHelpers -> DB: INSERT icu_patients\n+ UPDATE room occupancy
    DB --> ICUHelpers: icuPatientId
    API -> EHelpers: updateState('icu')
    EHelpers -> DB: UPDATE currentState
    DB --> EHelpers: Success
    ICUHelpers --> API: ICUPatient
    API --> Frontend: 200 OK
    Frontend -> Frontend: Redirect /admin/icu
end

== Gestionare ATI ==
loop Monitorizare continuă
    Doctor -> Frontend: Adaugă semne vitale
    Frontend -> API: POST /api/icu/patients/[id]/vital-signs
    API -> ICUHelpers: addVitalSigns()
    ICUHelpers -> DB: INSERT icu_vital_signs
    DB --> ICUHelpers: Success
    API --> Frontend: 200 OK
    
    Doctor -> Frontend: Adaugă tratament
    Frontend -> API: POST /api/icu/patients/[id]/treatments
    API -> ICUHelpers: addTreatment()
    ICUHelpers -> DB: INSERT icu_treatments
    DB --> ICUHelpers: Success
    API --> Frontend: 200 OK
end

== Externare ==
Doctor -> Frontend: Externare din ATI
Frontend -> API: DELETE /api/icu/patients/[id]
API -> ICUHelpers: dischargePatient()
ICUHelpers -> DB: UPDATE dischargeDate\n+ UPDATE room occupancy
DB --> ICUHelpers: Success
API -> EHelpers: updateState('discharge')
EHelpers -> DB: UPDATE currentState
DB --> EHelpers: Success
API --> Frontend: 200 OK

note right of EHelpers
  Tranziții valide:
  arrival → triage
  triage → consent
  consent → admission
  admission → treatment/icu
  treatment → icu/discharge
  icu → treatment/discharge
end note

@enduml
